{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/dropReports"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each batch dropped without being delivered, in the order they are dropped."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/dropreports"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"HTTPDestinations"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"HTTPDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination.swift#L185"},"title":"dropReports","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA14HTTPDropReportOy7FailureQy_GGvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HTTPDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Encoding"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Failure","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa"},{"kind":"text","text":">>"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO","text":"HTTPDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDropReport"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa","text":"Failure","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder\/Failure"},{"text":">> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait, without a bound, until they are read, so none is missed by reading late."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The sequence ends once the destination and every copy of it are gone and every report has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"been read. Read the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the task holds the sequence and not the destination:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let reports = collector.dropReports","Task {","    for await report in reports {","        logger.warning(\"Dropped a batch: \\(report)\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/HTTPDestination/dropReports":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO","text":"HTTPDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa","text":"Failure","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">>","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/dropReports","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each batch dropped without being delivered, in the order they are dropped."}],"type":"topic","title":"dropReports","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/dropreports"},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/HTTPDestination":{"url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination","title":"HTTPDestination","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that sends each batch it receives to an HTTP endpoint, as the requests its encoder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"splits it into, and sends each again until it arrives."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HTTPDestination"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HTTPDestination"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","role":"symbol"},"doc://AsyncQu